AMDGPU: backport vector memory types for cooperative atomics

Base: triton-lang/llvm-project 6bc4aaf6641c56ee104f6200c96a6a571bc77052

The memory-type fix and regression cases come from upstream LLVM commit
f8f362d165edce925b40468b84f2f68e7aa11f82 (#229501), by Gheorghe-Teodor
Bercea. The original change assigns each cooperative atomic's value type to
its memory type instead of using i64/i128 for vector values.

This pin also needs the corresponding vector selection patterns. The
v2i32/v4i32 global and flat patterns adapt the relevant part of upstream
3eb867f9b63ae2881bbe3c25d3c12842f2bdc55e (#229688), by Matt Arsenault,
without importing its wider all-type/all-address-space pattern refactor.

Golden checks for the upstream regressions have been regenerated with this
pin's llc to account for its register allocation and instruction scheduling.

diff --git a/llvm/lib/Target/AMDGPU/AMDGPUInstructions.td b/llvm/lib/Target/AMDGPU/AMDGPUInstructions.td
index d0607a2961a9..162d95670715 100644
--- a/llvm/lib/Target/AMDGPU/AMDGPUInstructions.td
+++ b/llvm/lib/Target/AMDGPU/AMDGPUInstructions.td
@@ -541,6 +541,13 @@ def atomic_load_nonext_128_#as : PatFrag<(ops node:$ptr), (atomic_load_nonext_12
   let IsAtomic = 1;
 }

+foreach vt = [v2i32, v4i32] in {
+def atomic_load_nonext_#vt#_#as : PatFrag<(ops node:$ptr), (atomic_load_nonext node:$ptr)> {
+  let IsAtomic = 1;
+  let MemoryVT = vt;
+}
+}
+
 def atomic_load_zext_8_#as : PatFrag<(ops node:$ptr), (atomic_load_zext_8 node:$ptr)> {
   let IsAtomic = 1;
 }
@@ -607,6 +614,12 @@ def atomic_store_64_#as : PatFrag<(ops node:$val, node:$ptr),
                                   (atomic_store_64 node:$val, node:$ptr)>;
 def atomic_store_128_#as : PatFrag<(ops node:$val, node:$ptr),
                                    (atomic_store_128 node:$val, node:$ptr)>;
+foreach vt = [v2i32, v4i32] in {
+def atomic_store_#vt#_#as : PatFrag<(ops node:$val, node:$ptr),
+                                   (atomic_store node:$val, node:$ptr)> {
+  let MemoryVT = vt;
+}
+}
 } // End let IsAtomic = 1, AddressSpaces = ...
 } // End foreach as

